<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Land stock suspended.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Land stock suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berjaya Land Bhd's stock was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>An official at Berjaya Land, which was formerly known as Berjaya Leisure Bhd, said an announcement would be issued later, but declined to disclose the nature of the news.</p>
<p>The company, which is involved in property development and hotel management, on Monday reported net profit of 104.74 million ringgit for the year ended April 30, 1997 compared with 26.22 million a year ago.</p>
<p>Shares of the company ended at 6.70 ringgit on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
